{"seq":3,"slug":"incentive-application-approval-disbursement","title":"激励申请、审批与兑现拨付流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/incentive-application-approval-disbursement","wordCount":2925,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"激励申请-审批与兑现拨付流程\">激励申请、审批与兑现拨付流程</h1><p>一家外资制造商在泰国提交投资促进申请后第七个月才拿到促进证书（Investment Promotion Certificate），随后才发现自己有一台关键设备在证书签发日之后才完成进口报关，被 BOI 认定为不符合免税进口的时点要求，整批设备的关税豁免作废。问题不出在资格，而出在<strong>流程时序</strong>——申请、批准、兑现三个环节各自带着互不相同的时点规则，而系统把它们当成了同一笔业务。</p>\n<p>资格认定回答的是&quot;能不能拿&quot;（见同章 <a href=\"incentive-policy-taxonomy-rule-model\">激励政策分类与可计算规则模型</a>），本篇处理的是更靠后的问题：<strong>一份已被判定的优惠，如何走完受理、审批、放款、核验这条生命周期，并保证每个环节的时点、材料与签核都可追溯。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-激励生命周期是一条带时点基准的状态机\">核心概念：激励生命周期是一条带时点基准的状态机</h2><p>把激励的执行过程画成一条直线是危险的，因为它掩盖了三个关键事实：每个阶段的<strong>时点基准不同</strong>、每个阶段的<strong>产出不同</strong>、每个阶段的<strong>证据强度要求不同</strong>。申请阶段回答&quot;计划是否可信&quot;，审批阶段回答&quot;条件是否合规&quot;，拨付阶段回答&quot;事实是否已发生&quot;——三者用的是不同性质的证据，不可互相替代。这正是&quot;资格合规&quot;与&quot;资金到账&quot;必须分成两个业务对象的原因。</p>\n<p>一条可用的激励生命周期至少包含三段九个状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>时点基准</th>\n<th>阶段产出</th>\n<th>证据强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申请受理</td>\n<td><code>submitted</code> → <code>under_review</code></td>\n<td>业务发生日、申报窗口</td>\n<td>结构化事实对象（冻结目录版本）</td>\n<td>申报材料自证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批</td>\n<td><code>conditional_approval</code></td>\n<td>证书生效日</td>\n<td>附条件批复（含回收条款）</td>\n<td>会签与合规审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑现拨付</td>\n<td><code>milestone_disbursing</code> → <code>active</code></td>\n<td>各里程碑完成日</td>\n<td>资金流水（分批次）</td>\n<td>里程碑独立验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存续与回收</td>\n<td><code>clawback_pending</code> → <code>closed</code></td>\n<td>复核/失效判定日</td>\n<td>追缴决定与计息</td>\n<td>持续报告 + 抽样审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者之间的边界由<strong>时点</strong>而非人员交接定义：证书生效日是免税进口资格的判定基准，晚于该日的进口行为即便发生在批准之后也不合格。系统若把这几个基准日折叠成一个字段，流程时序类缺陷就必然发生。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[submitted 提交] --&gt; B[under_review 审查]&#10;  B --&gt; C{形式+实质+财政&lt;br/&gt;三层通过?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| R[补正或拒绝&lt;br/&gt;结构化理由]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[conditional_approval 附条件批复]&#10;  D --&gt; E[milestone_disbursing 分期拨付]&#10;  E --&gt; F{里程碑证据校验?}&#10;  F --&gt;|通过| G[active 优惠生效]&#10;  F --&gt;|失败| H[暂缓并复核]&#10;  G --&gt; I{持续谓词仍成立?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[clawback_pending 追缴]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| G&#10;  J --&gt; K[closed 结清]\">flowchart TD\n  A[submitted 提交] --&gt; B[under_review 审查]\n  B --&gt; C{形式+实质+财政&lt;br/&gt;三层通过?}\n  C --&gt;|否| R[补正或拒绝&lt;br/&gt;结构化理由]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[conditional_approval 附条件批复]\n  D --&gt; E[milestone_disbursing 分期拨付]\n  E --&gt; F{里程碑证据校验?}\n  F --&gt;|通过| G[active 优惠生效]\n  F --&gt;|失败| H[暂缓并复核]\n  G --&gt; I{持续谓词仍成立?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[clawback_pending 追缴]\n  I --&gt;|是| G\n  J --&gt; K[closed 结清]</pre><h2 id=\"申请受理-时点窗口与材料清单是第一道门槛\">申请受理：时点窗口与材料清单是第一道门槛</h2><p>激励的申请不是随时可提的意向书，它受一个<strong>申报窗口</strong>约束：行为发生在窗口内才可申报，且申请必须在行为发生后的一定期限内提交。泰国 BOI 的规则把这条约束写得很硬——证书签发日决定免税进口设备的资格时点，晚于该日进口的机器不再享受关税豁免。因此系统在设计上必须把&quot;业务发生日&quot;&quot;申请提交日&quot;&quot;证书生效日&quot;三者分开存储，绝不能用一个 <code>created_at</code> 字段同时充当它们。</p>\n<p>受理阶段的工程职责是<strong>把非结构化的申请材料映射为可校验的结构化事实</strong>。典型材料清单与校验点包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>结构化产出</th>\n<th>校验点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>投资登记/公司注册文件</td>\n<td>主体标识、受益所有人</td>\n<td>主体与申报人一致、无制裁命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目可行性报告</td>\n<td>投资总额、产能、建设周期</td>\n<td>投资额与后续放款基数同源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行业与产品说明</td>\n<td>行业代码、产品类别</td>\n<td>落入鼓励类目录的版本号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用地/租赁协议</td>\n<td>区域代码、地块、期限</td>\n<td>所处园区与政策适用地一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实质运营证明</td>\n<td>雇员、社保、资产清单</td>\n<td>满足实质运营谓词的门槛</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里最容易出错的是<strong>目录版本</strong>。鼓励类产业目录、园区名录、优惠率每年都可能调整，申请提交时命中的是哪一版目录，必须随申请一起冻结。否则审批环节用新版目录复核旧申请，会产生&quot;当时合规、现在被判不合格&quot;的伪拒绝。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[意向登记] --&gt; B{是否在申报窗口内?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| Z[退回: 超窗口]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[提交材料]&#10;  C --&gt; D[结构化为事实对象&lt;br/&gt;冻结目录版本与业务发生日]&#10;  D --&gt; E{形式审查通过?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| Z2[补正通知: 缺失材料清单]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[进入审批]\">flowchart TD\n  A[意向登记] --&gt; B{是否在申报窗口内?}\n  B --&gt;|否| Z[退回: 超窗口]\n  B --&gt;|是| C[提交材料]\n  C --&gt; D[结构化为事实对象&lt;br/&gt;冻结目录版本与业务发生日]\n  D --&gt; E{形式审查通过?}\n  E --&gt;|否| Z2[补正通知: 缺失材料清单]\n  E --&gt;|是| F[进入审批]</pre><h2 id=\"审批-三层决策与援助强度审查\">审批：三层决策与援助强度审查</h2><p>审批不是单一部门的签字，而是一条<strong>分层会签</strong>：形式审查（材料齐备）、实质审查（资格谓词为真）、财政审查（优惠强度与预算约束）分别由不同角色完成。把三层压成一个&quot;审批通过&quot;状态，会导致后续追责时无法定位是哪一层判断出错。</p>\n<p>实质审查直接复用资格认定引擎的谓词求值结果，但审批还要叠加一层<strong>财政合规性判断</strong>，这层在纯税收优惠中常被忽略。欧盟的做法是把这类判断制度化：符合《通用集体豁免条例》（GBER, Regulation (EU) No 651/2014）条件的区域投资援助<strong>无须事前通报</strong>即可合法授予，该条例覆盖了约 96% 的国家援助；超出豁免范围或超过通报门槛的个案援助，必须事前向欧盟委员会单独通报并等待批准（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/State_aid_(European_Union)\">EU State aid 概览</a>）。这意味着审批引擎需要一个<strong>分流判断</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>route</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>自动批准</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>≤</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>上报通报</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{route} = \\begin{cases} \\text{自动批准}, &amp; B \\le \\bar{B} \\ \\wedge\\ g_{\\text{total}} \\le \\bar{g} \\\\ \\text{上报通报}, &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">route</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自动批准</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上报通报</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为个案援助金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为通报门槛，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为按合格成本折算的援助强度。这一分流点必须在审批环节显式建模，而不是留给人工判断——因为一旦漏报，后果是整个优惠被认定为违法援助并追回，而不是罚款。</p>\n<p>审批的产出是一份<strong>附条件的批复</strong>，而不是简单的通过/拒绝。条件通常包括：投资额不得低于申报值、建设须在约定期限内完成、取得土地使用权后须按期开工（新加坡裕廊工业区早期即以&quot;三个月内提交建筑图则、两年内建成&quot;作为 99 年地契的签发条件，参见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economic_Development_Board\">Economic Development Board 沿革</a>）。这些条件正是后续放款与核验的判据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兑现拨付-从批复到资金的里程碑式放款\">兑现拨付：从批复到资金的里程碑式放款</h2><p>批复不等于到账。税式优惠在申报时自动抵扣，属于<strong>即时兑现</strong>；而现金补助、租金减免、贷款贴息属于<strong>分期兑现</strong>，必须由里程碑触发。把两类混在一个放款状态里，会造成&quot;优惠已批复但资金未到账&quot;与&quot;优惠已到账&quot;无法区分，财务对账无从下手。</p>\n<p>里程碑放款的一般形式是按完成度分批释放，且每批有上限：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_k = \\min\\!\\left(\\rho_k \\cdot B,\\; \\rho_k \\cdot B \\cdot \\frac{e_k}{E_k}\\right),\\qquad \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\rho_k \\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个里程碑的放款比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该里程碑的实际完成量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为承诺完成量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span> 表达的是&quot;实际进度慢于承诺时按比例扣减、快于承诺时不多给&quot;——不允许超比例预付，因为预付一旦发生而项目失败，追回成本远高于分批放款的管理成本。</p>\n<p>拨付的<strong>证据要求高于审批</strong>。审批证明的是&quot;计划可信&quot;，拨付证明的是&quot;事实已发生&quot;。因此每个里程碑必须绑定可独立验证的证据：竣工验收报告、设备进口报关单、社保缴纳记录、发票与付款凭证。系统应把每一笔拨付与对应的证据快照一起入档，形成&quot;资金流水—里程碑—证据&quot;三方对账。税式优惠一侧，海南自由贸易港的设备进口免税要求进口行为发生在符合条件的主体与用途之下，其企业所得税 15% 优惠则要求企业<strong>既注册又实际运营</strong>在海南且属于鼓励类产业——&quot;注册&quot;与&quot;实际运营&quot;是两个独立谓词，后者需持续满足（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hainan_Free_Trade_Port\">Hainan Free Trade Port</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[附条件批复] --&gt; B[里程碑1 开工]&#10;  B --&gt; C{证据校验通过?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[拨付 D1]&#10;  D --&gt; E[里程碑2 竣验]&#10;  E --&gt; F{证据校验通过?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[拨付 D2]&#10;  G --&gt; H[里程碑3 投产达产]&#10;  H --&gt; I{证据校验通过?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[拨付 D3 尾款]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[暂缓并触发复核]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| K\">flowchart TD\n  A[附条件批复] --&gt; B[里程碑1 开工]\n  B --&gt; C{证据校验通过?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[拨付 D1]\n  D --&gt; E[里程碑2 竣验]\n  E --&gt; F{证据校验通过?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[拨付 D2]\n  G --&gt; H[里程碑3 投产达产]\n  H --&gt; I{证据校验通过?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[拨付 D3 尾款]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[暂缓并触发复核]\n  C --&gt;|否| K</pre><h2 id=\"事后核验与回收-报告义务决定优惠能否留住\">事后核验与回收：报告义务决定优惠能否留住</h2><p>优惠不是一次性授予，而是<strong>在优惠期内持续成立的附条件权益</strong>。因此拿到资金之后还有第三条流程线：定期报告、抽样审计、条件失效后的追缴。这条线在系统里最容易被省略，结果是优惠已落袋却无追缴依据。</p>\n<p>报告义务的工程意义在于它是<strong>持续谓词的输入源</strong>。实质运营、行业归类、投资额维持这些条件不会自动为真，需要企业按期申报并由系统重新求值。海南方言把人才个税优惠的适用明确设定了 2027 年的到期节点，说明期限窗口本身也需要持续监控，而非仅在授予时判断一次。</p>\n<p>当条件不再满足，追缴金额通常按已放款额加计利息计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\sum_{k=1}^{m} D_k \\cdot (1+i)^{\\,t - t_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0936em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 笔拨付的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为追缴决定时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 为约定的资金占用利率。追缴条款必须在批复时即写定利率与计息方式——事后补写会被企业以&quot;未经约定&quot;为由抗辩。系统应在规则对象中把回收条款作为必填项，缺失则拒绝生成批复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-状态机-幂等与证据留存\">工程实现：状态机、幂等与证据留存</h2><p>把上述三段流程统一到一个<strong>显式状态机</strong>上，是系统可控的最低要求。状态应至少区分：<code>submitted → under_review → conditional_approval → milestone_disbursing → active → clawback_pending → closed</code>。关键约束有三条：</p>\n<p><strong>时点字段不可复用。</strong> 业务发生日、申请日、证书生效日、各里程碑完成日必须独立存储，因为不同环节的规则引用不同的基准日。多数流程缺陷源于把其中两个混为一个字段。</p>\n<p><strong>拨付必须幂等。</strong> 放款是外部副作用，重试不得重复放款。每笔拨付以&quot;里程碑 + 批次&quot;为唯一键，重复请求返回既有结果而非新建流水。这正是&quot;超时并不代表未发生&quot;在资金环节的直接体现。</p>\n<p><strong>证据快照一并入档。</strong> 每次状态迁移记录：触发规则版本、输入事实、审批角色、证据引用。三者缺一，事后无法复现判断，也无法在争议中自证合规。审批与拨付的每一步都应留下不可变的事件记录，而不是只更新一个当前状态字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>申请受<strong>申报窗口</strong>约束，业务发生日、申请日、证书生效日必须分开存储；目录版本随申请冻结。</li>\n<li>审批是形式审查、实质审查、财政审查三层会签，并须在超豁免范围或超门槛时<strong>分流到上报通报</strong>（GBER 覆盖约 96% 的援助）。</li>\n<li>批复是<strong>附条件的</strong>，条件即为后续放款与核验的判据，必须在批复时写定。</li>\n<li>兑现分即时（税式抵扣）与分期（现金/租金/贴息）两类，分期按里程碑放款且不允许超比例预付。</li>\n<li>报告义务是持续谓词的输入源，优惠期内需周期重新求值；追缴额按已放款额加计<strong>批复时即约定</strong>的利息计算。</li>\n<li>工程上以显式状态机承载全流程，时点字段不复用、拨付幂等、证据快照与规则版本一并入档。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"激励申请、审批与兑现拨付流程","id":"激励申请-审批与兑现拨付流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：激励生命周期是一条带时点基准的状态机","id":"核心概念-激励生命周期是一条带时点基准的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"申请受理：时点窗口与材料清单是第一道门槛","id":"申请受理-时点窗口与材料清单是第一道门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"审批：三层决策与援助强度审查","id":"审批-三层决策与援助强度审查"},{"level":2,"text":"兑现拨付：从批复到资金的里程碑式放款","id":"兑现拨付-从批复到资金的里程碑式放款"},{"level":2,"text":"事后核验与回收：报告义务决定优惠能否留住","id":"事后核验与回收-报告义务决定优惠能否留住"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：状态机、幂等与证据留存","id":"工程实现-状态机-幂等与证据留存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"激励资格认定与优惠额度计算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/eligibility-calculation-engine"},"next":{"title":"实质性经营要求与优惠享受条件模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-compliance-risk-control/substance-requirement-benefit-condition"}}